<title>SPAIN: Continente sale nets 1.4 bln pta capital gain.</title>
<headline>Continente sale nets 1.4 bln pta capital gain.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish hypermarket Continente said on Thursday it has sold a plot of land to a private investor for 2.1 billion pesetas, with a capital gain of approximately 1.4 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>The Madrid property was not a strategic asset for the firm, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
